          "prompt": "Explain why the sky is blue in simple terms.",
          "serialised_prompt": "<|user|>\nExplain why the sky is blue in simple terms.\n<|/user|>\n<|assistant|>\n",
          "answer": "The sky is a classic example of a reflection in the sky, where light from different sources intersects with one another. This phenomenon occurs because the wavelengths of light in each object are scattered across the same line of sight and appear to be reflecting off or fading away as they enter our eyes' domain.",
