          "serialised_prompt": "<|user|>\nExplain how a neural network learns, using a simple analogy.\n<|/user|>\n<|assistant|>\n",
          "answer": "A neural network learns through a process called learning. In the context of the original analogy, we can think about it like this:\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import scikit_image\n\n# Define the training data\ndata = {'Name': 'John', 'Age': 25, 'Score': 20}\nsensor = scikit-learn(data)\nprint(\"Sensor training example:\", sensor)\n```\nIn this code snippet, `scikit",
          "seconds": 1.736,
