          "id": "brainstorm",
          "prompt": "Suggest three names for a friendly robot that helps people grow plants.",
          "serialised_prompt": "<|user|>\nSuggest three names for a friendly robot that helps people grow plants.\n<|/user|>\n<|assistant|>\n",
          "answer": "Here are three simple names for a friendly robot that helps people grow plants:\n```python\n# Define the name A, B and C for the garden\nA = [0]  # 1.0  # 0.0b is acceptable (no need to specify any constants)\n\n     def get_garden(self):\n        # Create an empty space in the center where you can plant flowers - or not",
