        {
          "id": "arithmetic",
          "prompt": "I have 3 boxes with 4 pencils in each box. How many pencils do I have altogether?",
          "serialised_prompt": "<|user|>\nI have 3 boxes with 4 pencils in each box. How many pencils do I have altogether?\n<|/user|>\n<|assistant|>\n",
          "answer": "You can use the same formula as before: 4 pencils in a box of three pencils. The formula is: (x - 2) * (3*1 + 1)(2)*(5-4), where x is the number of pencils, 2 is the number of pencils, and 3 is the total number of points on each box at that point along with the cost for the first two pencils or the remaining pencils if they are added together to form one larger square.",
