          "answer": "Here's a simple Python function to find the larger of two numbers:\n```python\ndef larger(nums):\n    return nums[1] if nums[0] != nums[1] else \"b\"\n```\nThis function uses the built-in `sum` function from Python, which returns the sum of the first element (or more specifically, the second element) and the second element. The result is then returned as an array.",
