{
  "date": "2026-10-26T07:50:33.570029+00:00",
  "scope": "Full SST-2 training and validation; full RACE-middle training, validation selection and held-out test. Historical GPT-1 figures use different training coverage and test sets.",
  "method": "Each task starts from the original pretrained WiggleGPT. All model weights are adapted using classifier cross-entropy plus an auxiliary language-model loss (weight 0.5), with GPT-1-style task markers and linear classifiers.",
  "control_method": "Before: original pretrained backbone with a newly initialized task classifier. After: the validation-selected task-trained checkpoint, using the same inputs and classifier format.",
