    "note": "OpenAI reported 91.3% on SST-2 (GLUE test) and 62.9% on RACE-M. This WiggleGPT run reports SST-2 public validation. GPT-1 trained on combined RACE-middle/high data; this adaptation uses middle-school training data. The historical scores provide context with these differences in training coverage and evaluation split."
  },
  "tasks": [
